    "title": "Police Investigate Homicide After Fire on Eastwood Drive in Our Community - NewsBreak",
    "text": "9 hours ago On October 19, 2025, Dallas Police responded to a fire at the 10000 block of Eastwood Drive at about 6:50 a.m. Officers managed traffic while firefighters worked to put out the fire.\nAfter the fire was extinguished, police found an unidentified person dead at the scene. The case was first recorded as a fire but is now being investigated as a homicide. Police ask anyone with information to contact Detective Kenneth Castoral.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.\n1",
